ign: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master the art of a sorceress apprentice and decipher your spellbook to cast the spells you need to progress through the six chapters of this introspective adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890020?t=1769204180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/472e44194d5305cabc8eea7fcd053accaea57475/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769204180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/1d8d585dd0fed189fd7141f9ab19b7ca2e1acb3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769204180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/1d8d585dd0fed189fd7141f9ab19b7ca2e1acb3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769204180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4054770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Remember to Wishlist the Game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/cf14a48ec690937c1ab2992f5be3fd7c.poster.avif?t=1769204180\" width=189 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/cf14a48ec690937c1ab2992f5be3fd7c.webm?t=1769204180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>We are a small indie team, and your feedback means a lot t